### 5.1 Score engine (L2)

| `engine_type` | Examples | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `additive_points` | CHA₂DS₂-VASc, CURB-65, qSOFA, HEART | Toggles / radio chips, points summed |
| `banded_lookup` | GCS, NEWS2, ECOG PS | Component tables → total → band |
| `formula` | CKD-EPI, MELD, anion gap, BSA | Typed AST evaluator with units; no string `eval` |
| `regression` | Logistic / Cox-style models | Coefficients in data; `1/(1+e^-x)` supported; **blocked** if coefficients are missing |
| `classification` | CCS angina class | Selector only |
| `multi_component` | WIfI | Independent sub-scores → combined stage lookup |
| `questionnaire` | PHQ-9 and other item-based scales | Item lists, per-item scoring, severity bands |
| `date_based` | EDD, gestational age | Date pickers, no timezone bugs |
| `converter` | Unit conversions | Analyte-aware (e.g., glucose, creatinine, HbA1c) — list derived from the files, not invented |

Form renderer widgets (chosen by `widget_hints` / variable type): toggle · radio chips · stepper · slider · numeric with **unit switch** · date picker · dropdown. Live recompute on every change. Validation with plausible-range warnings (warn, don't block).

Every tool screen shows: inputs → **result** → active band highlighted ("you are here") → interpretation → formula → citation (+PMID where present) → validation population → limitations → confidence chip → copyright status.

